%%text SANTIANA
%%text 
%%text O Santiana gained the day
%%text Hoo-ray, Santiana!
%%text He lost it once but gained it twice
%%text All on the plains of Mexico!
%%text 
%%text O Santiana fought for fame
%%text And that's where Santy gained his name.
%%text 
%%text O Santiana fought for gold
%%text And the deeds he done have oft been told.
%%text 
%%text And Santiana fought for his life
%%text But he gained his way in a terrible strife.
%%text 
%%text O Santiana's day is o'er
%%text And Santiana will fight no more.
%%text 
%%text I thought I heard the old man say
%%text He'd give us grog this very day.
